{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up at <strong>The Gateway, c</strong>onfront the mirrors, and close the <strong>6 eyes</strong> of the demons keeping you imprisoned! This is a <strong>fast paced rouge-like shooter</strong>, with a combat system that forces every bullet and move to matter.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, shooting is based on a turn timer which you can influence. Every time you dash, or kill enemies the turn timer will move faster. Playing fast and reckless will allow you too attack very fast, <i>but careful not to be  too reckless!<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>Missing bullets will slow down your timer.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to face a demon, you will need to clear 3 <strong>randomly generated</strong> islands. Which are guarded by monsters.\u00a0Survive islands with the help of <strong>perks</strong> and <strong>upgrades.</strong> These will help you become more and more powerful the further you get. With\u00a0<strong>infinitely</strong>\u00a0stacking perks and your own skills, the monsters will have a hard time stopping you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span>\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Areas and boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking perks and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with 7 tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"OPEN YOUR EYES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/8d1539680ad704a8221bc76a809b7926e595e6f9.jpg"},{"name":"PLACES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/a5adfc81eac29702a7ed814710aff03c6f2a20ba.jpg"},{"name":"THOUGTHS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/c166c4d8ab4d9a6a4d288408d4f2ba6d4d2d8a1d.jpg"},{"name":"HOPES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/35220912ee1ad66bdc6cf0b334bd6c59bbf22ea8.jpg"},{"name":"LIGHTS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/898a5184eae67d872ed6fd7a89daf2edd583aa59.jpg"},{"name":"FEELINGS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/7fc45d4e95c96f20b74e770ea5cc66fe6f285432.jpg"},{"name":"LOOKS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/56904c6ebf3484d4cc562c5f267c89995657493b.jpg"},{"name":"ASSULT RIFLE MASTERY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/3b218bb0c5869a6b5e8940d308fe6fcf75851e24.jpg"},{"name":"SMG MASTERY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/09027015aee61a4a0f1a21851452e616da9dcdbd.jpg"},{"name":"SNIPER MASTERY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863460/79142c8925e966e17aefa6e3575e570f7ca66374.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863460?t=1756432650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863460/4ccdb2a14ecf1c9a8d988ccbd0bc8a780c1fdb70/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756432650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st